      174.09,
      226.97,
      388.53,
      250.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MUSLIM MARRIAGE AND DIVORCE ACT(CHAPTER 115)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      262.97,
      400.96,
      286.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      400.9,
      334.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Muslim Marriage andDivorce (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013 and shall be deemedto have come into operation from January 1, 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.97,
      400.94,
      406.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 18 of the Muslim Marriage and Divorce Act(Chapter 115) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection(3) of that section and the substitution therefor of thefollowing subsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      185.85,
      418.97,
      400.93,
      442.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(3) The prescribed fee shall be paid by thebridegroom.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      454.97,
      400.96,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 94 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in paragraph (h) of subsection (1) of that sectionby the substitution, for the words \u201c the stamp fee to be paidon a certified copy\u201d, of the words \u201c the fee to be paid on acertified copy\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      527.17,
      400.95,
      610.24
    ],
    "text": "4.Any fees charged or collected by or on behalf of theRegistrar- General or any person authorised under this Act,for any purpose authorized by this Act to charge or collect,from January 1, 2013 and ending on March 31, 2013, shall bedeemed to have been validly charged or collected by theRegistrar- General or by any such person authorised underthis Act:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      623.17,
      400.91,
      672.28
    ],
    "text": "Provided that the aforesaid provisions of this section shallnot affect any decision or order made by any Court or anyproceedings pending in any Court in respect of any feecharged or collected during the aforesaid period.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
